{"seq":3,"slug":"feedback-loop-architecture","title":"反馈闭环架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/foundations/feedback-loop-architecture","wordCount":959,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"反馈闭环架构\">反馈闭环架构</h1><p>单次执行的 agent 产出的是一次性建议。构成闭环的 agent 产出的是持续改进的系统能力。两者的差距，在于 agent 的输出是否被记录、是否与后续事件关联、是否被用来改进下一次执行。</p>\n<p>本文描述 AI 原生 CI/CD 中反馈闭环的设计模式：从单次触发到记忆积累，从被动响应到主动优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>反馈闭环</strong>（Feedback Loop）指 agent 执行的产出不只影响当次的门控决策，还被持久化存储，在下次执行时作为历史上下文注入，从而让 agent 的判断逐步接近团队的真实偏好。</p>\n<p><strong>误报率</strong>（False Positive Rate, FPR）是衡量 agent 质量的核心指标，计算方式为 <code>被工程师拒绝的发现数 / 总发现数</code>。FPR 持续高于 20% 会侵蚀工程师信任，最终导致 agent 输出被系统性忽略，这是 AI 质量门失效的最常见路径。</p>\n<p><strong>Prompt 版本化</strong>（Prompt Versioning）将 Prompt 视为可版本管理的软件组件，通过关联每个版本的 FPR 变化，使 Prompt 优化变得数据驱动而非凭感觉调整。</p>\n<h2 id=\"闭环的三个层次\">闭环的三个层次</h2><p>反馈闭环在 AI 原生 CI/CD 中有三个层次，复杂度和收益递增：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph L1[层次一:单次输出]&#10;        A1[Agent 执行] --&gt; B1[产出结果]&#10;        B1 --&gt; C1[PR 评论 / 门控]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph L2[层次二:历史积累]&#10;        A2[Agent 执行] --&gt; B2[产出结果]&#10;        B2 --&gt; C2[存入历史数据库]&#10;        C2 --&gt; D2[下次执行时注入历史上下文]&#10;        D2 --&gt; A2&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph L3[层次三:自适应优化]&#10;        A3[Agent 执行] --&gt; B3[产出结果]&#10;        B3 --&gt; C3[记录 + 人工确认]&#10;        C3 --&gt; D3[计算 precision/recall]&#10;        D3 --&gt; E3[调整 Prompt / 阈值]&#10;        E3 --&gt; A3&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph L1[层次一:单次输出]\n        A1[Agent 执行] --&gt; B1[产出结果]\n        B1 --&gt; C1[PR 评论 / 门控]\n    end\n\n    subgraph L2[层次二:历史积累]\n        A2[Agent 执行] --&gt; B2[产出结果]\n        B2 --&gt; C2[存入历史数据库]\n        C2 --&gt; D2[下次执行时注入历史上下文]\n        D2 --&gt; A2\n    end\n\n    subgraph L3[层次三:自适应优化]\n        A3[Agent 执行] --&gt; B3[产出结果]\n        B3 --&gt; C3[记录 + 人工确认]\n        C3 --&gt; D3[计算 precision/recall]\n        D3 --&gt; E3[调整 Prompt / 阈值]\n        E3 --&gt; A3\n    end</pre><p>大多数团队从层次一开始，逐步演进到层次二，少数精益团队会推进到层次三。</p>\n<h2 id=\"层次二-历史积累模式\">层次二：历史积累模式</h2><h3 id=\"数据模型设计\">数据模型设计</h3><p>持久化 agent 执行记录的核心数据结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface AgentExecution {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  agent_type: &#39;code-review&#39; | &#39;test-gen&#39; | &#39;failure-triage&#39; | &#39;security&#39;;&#10;  trigger: {&#10;    type: &#39;event&#39; | &#39;scheduled&#39; | &#39;on-demand&#39;;&#10;    pr_number?: number;&#10;    commit_sha: string;&#10;    branch: string;&#10;  };&#10;  executed_at: string; // ISO 8601&#10;  prompt_version: string; // semver，用于追踪 Prompt 变更影响&#10;  findings: Finding[];&#10;  summary: ExecutionSummary;&#10;  outcome?: {&#10;    // 人工确认后回填&#10;    accepted_findings: string[]; // finding.id 列表&#10;    rejected_findings: string[];&#10;    false_positive_rate?: number;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AgentExecution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  agent_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'code-review'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'test-gen'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failure-triage'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'security'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  trigger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'event'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'scheduled'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'on-demand'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    pr_number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    commit_sha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    branch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  executed_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ISO 8601</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  prompt_version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// semver，用于追踪 Prompt 变更影响</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  findings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Finding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  summary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExecutionSummary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 人工确认后回填</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    accepted_findings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// finding.id 列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    rejected_findings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    false_positive_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"注入历史上下文\">注入历史上下文</h3><p>在 agent 的下次执行中，将相关历史数据注入 system prompt：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function buildAgentContext(prNumber, filePath) {&#10;  // 查询该文件在过去 90 天内的 agent 发现&#10;  const history = await db.query(&#10;    `&#10;    SELECT f.category, f.file, f.line, f.message, e.outcome&#10;    FROM findings f&#10;    JOIN agent_executions e ON f.execution_id = e.id&#10;    WHERE f.file = $1&#10;      AND e.executed_at &gt; NOW() - INTERVAL &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;    ORDER BY e.executed_at DESC&#10;    LIMIT 10&#10;  `,&#10;    [filePath],&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  const falsePositives = history.filter((h) =&gt; h.outcome?.rejected_findings?.includes(h.id));&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    system_context: `&#10;      Historical context for ${filePath}:&#10;      - Previous findings in this file: ${history.length}&#10;      - Known false positive patterns: ${falsePositives.map((f) =&gt; f.message).join(&#39;; &#39;)}&#10;      - Please avoid re-flagging these patterns unless you have specific new evidence.&#10;    `,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildAgentContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">filePath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 查询该文件在过去 90 天内的 agent 发现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> history</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT f.category, f.file, f.line, f.message, e.outcome</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM findings f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    JOIN agent_executions e ON f.execution_id = e.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE f.file = $1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      AND e.executed_at > NOW() - INTERVAL '90 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ORDER BY e.executed_at DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LIMIT 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  `</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [filePath],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> falsePositives</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> history.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h.outcome?.rejected_findings?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(h.id));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    system_context: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      Historical context for ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">filePath</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      - Previous findings in this file: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">history</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      - Known false positive patterns: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">falsePositives</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">message</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'; '</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      - Please avoid re-flagging these patterns unless you have specific new evidence.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    `</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"误报率追踪与质量度量\">误报率追踪与质量度量</h2><p>闭环的质量依赖于对 agent 产出的持续度量。核心指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>健康阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>误报率（False Positive Rate）</strong></td>\n<td><code>rejected / total_findings</code></td>\n<td>&lt; 20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>有效发现率（True Positive Rate）</strong></td>\n<td><code>accepted / total_findings</code></td>\n<td>&gt; 60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>覆盖率（Recall）</strong></td>\n<td>需要手动抽样人工比对</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>平均执行延迟</strong></td>\n<td><code>p95(execution_duration_ms)</code></td>\n<td>&lt; 60s（轻量 review）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>门控阻断率</strong></td>\n<td><code>blocked_prs / total_prs</code></td>\n<td>&lt; 5%（过高说明噪音大）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>误报率是最重要的健康指标。误报率持续超过 20% 会侵蚀工程师信任，最终导致 agent 结论被系统性忽略。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    E[Agent 发现] --&gt; H{工程师判断}&#10;    H --&gt;|接受 Accepted| TP[True Positive]&#10;    H --&gt;|拒绝 Rejected| FP[False Positive]&#10;    H --&gt;|忽略 Ignored| U[Uncategorized]&#10;&#10;    TP --&gt; METRIC[更新指标]&#10;    FP --&gt; METRIC&#10;    U --&gt; ALERT[超阈值时触发 Prompt 审查]\">flowchart LR\n    E[Agent 发现] --&gt; H{工程师判断}\n    H --&gt;|接受 Accepted| TP[True Positive]\n    H --&gt;|拒绝 Rejected| FP[False Positive]\n    H --&gt;|忽略 Ignored| U[Uncategorized]\n\n    TP --&gt; METRIC[更新指标]\n    FP --&gt; METRIC\n    U --&gt; ALERT[超阈值时触发 Prompt 审查]</pre><h2 id=\"层次三-自适应优化\">层次三：自适应优化</h2><h3 id=\"prompt-版本与效果关联\">Prompt 版本与效果关联</h3><p>当 Prompt 版本升级时，需要对比新旧版本的误报率变化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"误报率对比：&#10;  Prompt v1.0.0: FPR = 28%（过于激进）&#10;  Prompt v1.1.0: FPR = 19%（调整后改善）&#10;  Prompt v1.2.0: FPR = 22%（引入新规则后轻微上升）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>误报率对比：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Prompt v1.0.0: FPR = 28%（过于激进）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Prompt v1.1.0: FPR = 19%（调整后改善）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Prompt v1.2.0: FPR = 22%（引入新规则后轻微上升）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Prompt 版本与指标的关联查询：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按 Prompt 版本计算误报率&#10;SELECT&#10;  prompt_version,&#10;  COUNT(*) AS total_findings,&#10;  SUM(CASE WHEN outcome_accepted THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS accepted,&#10;  ROUND(&#10;    100.0 * SUM(CASE WHEN outcome_rejected THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) / COUNT(*),&#10;    2&#10;  ) AS false_positive_rate&#10;FROM findings f&#10;JOIN agent_executions e ON f.execution_id = e.id&#10;WHERE e.executed_at &gt; NOW() - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY prompt_version&#10;ORDER BY prompt_version;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按 Prompt 版本计算误报率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prompt_version,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_findings,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outcome_accepted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accepted,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outcome_rejected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false_positive_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> findings f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> agent_executions e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">execution_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">executed_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prompt_version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prompt_version;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"阈值自动调整\">阈值自动调整</h3><p>基于历史数据，动态调整门控阈值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 基于过去 7 天数据计算推荐阈值&#10;async function computeAdaptiveThreshold(agentType) {&#10;  const stats = await getRecentStats(agentType, 7);&#10;&#10;  // 如果过去 7 天 FPR &gt; 25%，放宽阈值（减少阻断）&#10;  // 如果过去 7 天 FPR &lt; 10%，收紧阈值（增加阻断）&#10;  const baseThreshold = &#39;warning&#39;;&#10;  if (stats.falsePositiveRate &gt; 0.25) {&#10;    return { threshold: &#39;critical&#39;, reason: &#39;High FPR, reducing false blocks&#39; };&#10;  } else if (stats.falsePositiveRate &lt; 0.1) {&#10;    return { threshold: &#39;warning&#39;, reason: &#39;Low FPR, safe to tighten gate&#39; };&#10;  }&#10;  return { threshold: baseThreshold, reason: &#39;Within healthy range&#39; };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 基于过去 7 天数据计算推荐阈值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeAdaptiveThreshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">agentType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stats</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getRecentStats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(agentType, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 如果过去 7 天 FPR > 25%，放宽阈值（减少阻断）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 如果过去 7 天 FPR &#x3C; 10%，收紧阈值（增加阻断）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> baseThreshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'warning'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stats.falsePositiveRate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { threshold: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'critical'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'High FPR, reducing false blocks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stats.falsePositiveRate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { threshold: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'warning'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Low FPR, safe to tighten gate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { threshold: baseThreshold, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Within healthy range'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"闭环与-prompt-版本化的关系\">闭环与 Prompt 版本化的关系</h2><p>反馈闭环积累的数据是 Prompt 优化的原料。每次 Prompt 升级都应该：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>有具体问题驱动（误报率超阈值、漏报某类 bug、执行过慢）</li>\n<li>对应具体的历史数据佐证</li>\n<li>升级后追踪指标变化验证效果</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这将 Prompt 从&quot;写一次不再动&quot;变成可迭代的系统组件。关于 Prompt 版本化的工程实践，参见本 hub 第四章 <a href=\"../operations/prompt-versioning-observability\">Prompt 版本化与可观测性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"闭环设计的工程边界\">闭环设计的工程边界</h2><p>闭环不是越复杂越好。在团队规模较小时，层次三的收益不抵工程维护成本。推荐的演进路径：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    TEAM_SIZE{团队规模}&#10;    TEAM_SIZE --&gt;|&lt; 10 人| L1[层次一:单次输出\\n+ 人工观察]&#10;    TEAM_SIZE --&gt;|10-50 人| L2[层次二:历史积累\\n+ 误报率追踪]&#10;    TEAM_SIZE --&gt;|&gt; 50 人| L3[层次三:自适应优化\\n+ Prompt 自动调参]\">flowchart LR\n    TEAM_SIZE{团队规模}\n    TEAM_SIZE --&gt;|&lt; 10 人| L1[层次一:单次输出\\n+ 人工观察]\n    TEAM_SIZE --&gt;|10-50 人| L2[层次二:历史积累\\n+ 误报率追踪]\n    TEAM_SIZE --&gt;|&gt; 50 人| L3[层次三:自适应优化\\n+ Prompt 自动调参]</pre><p>关于单次触发的基础设计，参见 <a href=\"agent-in-pipeline-patterns\">Agent 嵌入流水线的触发模式</a>。关于流水线如何产出高质量的信号供闭环使用，参见 <a href=\"ai-friendly-pipeline-design\">AI 友好的流水线设计</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>反馈闭环是让 AI 质量门从&quot;有用&quot;演进到&quot;可靠&quot;的关键机制。三个层次（单次输出、历史积累、自适应优化）代表不同的投入产出比，小团队从层次一开始，随团队规模和成熟度演进。核心操作是：持久化 agent 执行记录、追踪工程师对发现的接受/拒绝反馈、以 FPR 为核心健康指标、将历史上下文注入下次执行。FPR 超过 20% 是需要立即介入的告警信号。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"反馈闭环架构","id":"反馈闭环架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"闭环的三个层次","id":"闭环的三个层次"},{"level":2,"text":"层次二：历史积累模式","id":"层次二-历史积累模式"},{"level":3,"text":"数据模型设计","id":"数据模型设计"},{"level":3,"text":"注入历史上下文","id":"注入历史上下文"},{"level":2,"text":"误报率追踪与质量度量","id":"误报率追踪与质量度量"},{"level":2,"text":"层次三：自适应优化","id":"层次三-自适应优化"},{"level":3,"text":"Prompt 版本与效果关联","id":"prompt-版本与效果关联"},{"level":3,"text":"阈值自动调整","id":"阈值自动调整"},{"level":2,"text":"闭环与 Prompt 版本化的关系","id":"闭环与-prompt-版本化的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"闭环设计的工程边界","id":"闭环设计的工程边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"AI 友好的流水线设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/foundations/ai-friendly-pipeline-design"},"next":{"title":"CI 中的 AI 代码审查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/quality-gates/ai-code-review-in-ci"}}